message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Learning Heuristics for A* in Imperfect Mazes with Q-Learning"
abstract: "We use tabular Q-learning to learn a cost-to-go heuristic for A* search and compare it against Manhattan and Euclidean heuristics on a dataset of 1500 imperfect mazes with loops."
